<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Holy Priest</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop item level 553 Tier 16. The two pieces of normal raid-level tier that can be acquired here are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99118/legwraps-of-the-ternion-glory">
<img alt="Legwraps of the Ternion Glory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_n_01pant.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of the Ternion Glory</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99131/handwraps-of-the-ternion-glory">
<img alt="Handwraps of the Ternion Glory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_n_01glove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handwraps of the Ternion Glory</span></a>. Eventually you will replace these with heroic-level tier from the raid, but getting one of them early can let you access the power spike of your tierset earlier, which is a good boost.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos can drop several level 559 items. Some are especially good, like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105778/derevkas-gleaming-girdle">
<img alt="Derevka's Gleaming Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_n_01belt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Derevka's Gleaming Girdle</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105795/bo-he-mes-deathwind-mantle">
<img alt="Bo He Me's Deathwind Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_n_01shoulder.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bo He Me's Deathwind Mantle</span></a>, but any item without hit rating that you can get from here would be a gain over non-tier celestial gear.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_staff_2h_pandarenmonk_c_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Timeless Isle Items for Holy Priest</span></h2>The Timeless Isle in Phase 5 is great for catching up on gear.  You will earn <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> for almost all activities that you participate in.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103988/contemplation-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Contemplation of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_cranegod.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Contemplation of Chi-Ji</span></a> can be a very good option if you don't have Throne of Thunder trinkets. It costs 50,000 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> so you will need to save for it.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">For a catch up weapon, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105921/cloudscorcher-greatstaff">
<img alt="Cloudscorcher Greatstaff" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudscorcher Greatstaff</span></a> can be bought for 20,000 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">You can get item level 496 items for all the other slots by buying <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104013/timeless-cloth-armor-cache">
<img alt="Timeless Cloth Armor Cache" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_23_netherweave.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Cloth Armor Cache</span></a> for 7,500 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Holy Priest Pre-Raid Trinkets in Phase 5</span></h2>
<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>Almost all of the relevant options this patch are passive trinkets. The one exception is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103988/contemplation-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Contemplation of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_cranegod.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Contemplation of Chi-Ji</span></a>, which you would simply use on cooldown.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104976/prismatic-prison-of-pride">
<img alt="Prismatic Prison of Pride" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prismatic Prison of Pride</span></a> - The strongest trinket in the raid. The stat amplification effect is great, and while the intellect proc doesn't have the best uptime, the whole package is still good enough to lock it in as your best trinket for the patch.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105117/dysmorphic-samophlange-of-discontinuity">
<img alt="Dysmorphic Samophlange of Discontinuity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dysmorphic Samophlange of Discontinuity</span></a> - The mana regeneration option, which is always good for holy priest. This trinket is very strong for the spec as mana is a common limiting factor for our throughput.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105109/thoks-acid-grooved-tooth">
<img alt="Thok's Acid-Grooved Tooth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thok's Acid-Grooved Tooth</span></a> - This would be our choice for second trinket in all situations if it wasn't for the short range of its effect. It is very strong when the raid is stacked, but any type of spreading will make its value go down very quickly.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105051/nazgrims-burnished-insignia">
<img alt="Nazgrim's Burnished Insignia" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nazgrim's Burnished Insignia</span></a> - The more straightforward of the options for your second slot. If you don't find yourself having mana issues but don't want to deal with the stacking requirement of Thok's, this would be your choice.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103988/contemplation-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Contemplation of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_cranegod.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Contemplation of Chi-Ji</span></a> - A good catch-up option from Timeless Isle. You would simply use it on cooldown.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96757/horridons-last-gasp">
<img alt="Horridon's Last Gasp" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_eyeofthestorm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Horridon's Last Gasp</span></a> - One of the top choices from Throne of Thunder. If you are coming into tier already having this one, you will likely keep it until you have access to higher-level versions of the Siege of Orgrimmar trinkets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96933/lightning-imbued-chalice">
<img alt="Lightning-Imbued Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_mage_runeofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning-Imbued Chalice</span></a> - One of the top choices from Throne of Thunder. If you are coming into tier already having this one, you will likely keep it until you have access to higher-level versions of the Siege of Orgrimmar trinkets.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="legendary-cloak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendary_theblackprince.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Holy Priest</span></h2>With the removal of Raid Finder in Mists of Pandaria Classic, it is possible to earn your Legendary Cloak without ever setting foot into a raid.  This can be done inside Celestial Dungeons.  <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102247/jina-kang-kindness-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Jina-Kang, Kindness of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_cranehealer_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jina-Kang, Kindness of Chi-Ji</span></a> - On top of a 5% increase to all healing done, the overhealing redistribution effect is extremely powerful in a spec like Holy Priest that has very strong heals but sometimes struggles with getting them into the correct targets and does a good amount of overhealing.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Holy Priests</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="emperor-shaohao">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentgodmount_gold.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Emperor Shaohao</span></h3>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>Emperor Shaohao is a new faction introduced on the Timeless Isle.  This faction is purely for vanity loot only.<br/>
<br/>The new raid faction in phase 3, <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>, has some useful items you can buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. You will gain reputation with it by killing bosses inside the raid. The open-world reputations <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a> and <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a> also have some lower-level rewards that might be relevant.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan.jpg");'></ins>
